  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Eesens was established on 2020 and targets to develop electronic smart products for outdoor activity. We care the users&rsquo; personal safety and property security. <strong>Shield smart bike tail light</strong> is our first product on market. It has many features of riding safety and anti-theft, the most concerns for every bike commuter. The smart ride light of Shield provide head-controlled turn signal, sensor brake signal, automatic day flash light, automatic on/off and SOS alarm. In addition, Shield has ultimate theft alarm solution. When detecting the bike is moved, Shield will blast loud sound and bright flash light to defer the thief. At same time, Shield will alert the user, with long wireless communication, to stop the theft in time. These features are innovated only by Eesens.&nbsp; <br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">You can check our official website and social media.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Eesens official website: <a href=\"http://www.eesens.com\">www.eesens.com</a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">YouTube channel: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/c/eesens\">www.youtube.com/c/eesens</a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Facebook: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Eesens-109816187650699/?modal=admin_todo_tour\">https://www.facebook.com/Eesens-109816187650699/?modal=admin_todo_tour</a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">You can write to us at <a href=\"mailto:salespartner@eesens.com\">sales@eesens.com</a> for more information</span></p>",
